      "comment": "True SERVICE ANIMALS - highly trained and LEGITIMATELY documented and necessary to a disabled person should always be allowed on.  <br/><br/>&quot;Emotional support animals&quot; on the other hand are close to a con.  $75 allows anyone to download a &quot;certificate&quot; from the internet.  And with that Paris Hilton gets to bring her dog on an airline because without him she suffers &quot;anxiety&quot;.  Please.<br/><br/>I actually have no allergies and love all animals - but the ESAs are causing a deserved backlash against the people who have a legal and legitimate need for service animals.  And that&#39;s not fair.",
